    "Description": "This is a pencil drawing of Dentzel Jumping Pig 7A. The drawing depicts the romance side of the animal. The upper right corner reads, \"No. 7A, Pig Romance Side.\" Below this is, \"Matched with 14A gray body (shaded to cream).\" The pig's body is an outline and only the tack is colored. In the upper left corner is a Munsell color key. In the top center is a note, \"do more on body color when animal is cleaned off.\" A note pointing to the heads is, \"spot covers top over the ear.\" Notations point to leaf detailing on the saddle are, \"brown-no good match,\" and \"yellow vein lines in leaf, Rabbit colors blended.\"",
